Isle for Ubuntu (unofficial clone)
========================================
After installing:
  1. Log out and log back in (needed once on Wayland so GNOME Shell sees the new extension).
  2. Run:  nusa-notch-enable      (or turn it on in the Extensions app)

Settings: click the gear at the right end of the notch's page bar, or run
  gnome-extensions prefs nusa-notch@linux-clone

Uninstall: sudo apt remove nusa-notch
User data lives in ~/.local/share/nusa-notch (delete it to reset tasks/water/shelf).
